@baseUrl = http://localhost:5084
@now = {{$datetime iso8601}}

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Ingest a batch (timestamps generated by the client at send time)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/readings
Content-Type: application/json

[
  { "deviceId": "sensor-0042", "timestamp": "{{$datetime iso8601 -1 m}}", "value": 21.5 },
  { "deviceId": "sensor-0042", "timestamp": "{{$datetime iso8601}}", "value": 22.5 }
]

### Query aggregates
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/sensor-0042/aggregates

### Unknown device -> 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/does-not-exist/aggregates

### Not an array -> 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/readings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "deviceId": "x" }

### Wrong content type -> 415
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/readings
Content-Type: text/plain

[]

### Query by query string (ids containing a slash)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/aggregates?deviceId=sensor-0042

